<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74087" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνθυλ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dress with forced meat</i> or <i>stuffing,</i> in
			cookery, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς τευθίδας . . . ὠνθύλευσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.
					84.5
				</span></i>
			 :—mostly in 
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὠνθυλευμένος στέατι Σικελικῷ</span>”
				<i>stuffed,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					119
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄρνα . . ὠνθυλευμένον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					90
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sotad.
			</span></i> Com.<i><span class="en">
				1.15
			</span></i> : the collat. form <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονθυλεύω</span> is condemned by <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				334
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονθύλευσις</span> (in pl., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ περιτταὶ σκευασίαι</span>
			) occurs in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.60
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μονθυλευτὴ κοιλία</span>
				Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				342
			</span></i> ; and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεμονθυλευμένος</span> is
				f.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				273
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>doctor</i> wine, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1064
			</span></i>.</div>
